#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:3
msgid "RobotSensors"
msgstr "RobotSensors"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:9
msgid "The ``RobotSensors`` class groups together all sensors used by the robot."
msgstr "La classe ``RobotSensors`` regroupe tous les capteurs utilisés par le robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:11
msgid ""
"It centralizes access to Webots sensors so that ``TERBot`` does not "
"directly manipulate ``DistanceSensor``, ``Camera`` or ``TouchSensor`` "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Elle centralise l'accès aux capteurs Webots afin que ``TERBot`` ne "
"manipule pas directement les objets ``DistanceSensor``, ``Camera`` ou "
"``TouchSensor``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:16
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:18
msgid "Retrieve Webots sensors."
msgstr "Récupérer les capteurs Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:19
msgid "Enable sensors using the simulation time step."
msgstr "Activer les capteurs avec le pas de temps de la simulation."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:20
msgid "Read distances on the left, right and front sides."
msgstr "Lire les distances à gauche, à droite et devant."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:21
msgid "Read the state of the touch sensor."
msgstr "Lire l'état du capteur de contact."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:22
msgid "Read the average color detected by the camera."
msgstr "Lire la couleur moyenne détectée par la caméra."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:23
msgid "Detect whether the observed color is red."
msgstr "Détecter si la couleur observée est rouge."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:27
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:29
msgid ""
"The sensors are stored in private attributes: ``dsRight``, ``dsLeft``, "
"``dsFront``, ``colorSensor`` and ``touchFront``."
msgstr ""
"Les capteurs sont stockés dans des attributs privés : ``dsRight``, "
"``dsLeft``, ``dsFront``, ``colorSensor`` et ``touchFront``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:34
msgid "Relations with other classes"
msgstr "Relations avec les autres classes"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:36
msgid "``RobotSensors`` is owned by ``TERBot``."
msgstr "``RobotSensors`` est possédée par ``TERBot``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:38
msgid ""
"It depends on ``DistanceSensor``, ``Camera``, ``TouchSensor`` and "
"``Supervisor``."
msgstr ""
"Elle dépend de ``DistanceSensor``, ``Camera``, ``TouchSensor`` et "
"``Supervisor``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:43
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:46
msgid "``RobotSensors(Supervisor robot, int timeStep)``"
msgstr "``RobotSensors(Supervisor robot, int timeStep)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:48
msgid "Constructor."
msgstr "Constructeur."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:50
msgid ""
"It retrieves the ``ds_right``, ``ds_left``, ``ds_front``, "
"``color_sensor`` and ``touch_front`` sensors."
msgstr ""
"Il récupère les capteurs ``ds_right``, ``ds_left``, ``ds_front``, "
"``color_sensor`` et ``touch_front``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:53
msgid "Each detected sensor is enabled using ``enable(timeStep)``."
msgstr ""
"Chaque capteur trouvé est activé avec ``enable(timeStep)``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:56
msgid "``getRightDistance()``"
msgstr "``getRightDistance()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:58
msgid "Returns the value of the right distance sensor."
msgstr "Retourne la valeur du capteur de distance droit."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:60
#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:67
msgid "If the sensor does not exist, it returns ``0.0``."
msgstr "Si le capteur n'existe pas, retourne ``0.0``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:63
msgid "``getLeftDistance()``"
msgstr "``getLeftDistance()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:65
msgid "Returns the value of the left distance sensor."
msgstr "Retourne la valeur du capteur de distance gauche."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:70
msgid "``getFrontDistance()``"
msgstr "``getFrontDistance()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:72
msgid "Returns the value of the front distance sensor."
msgstr "Retourne la valeur du capteur de distance avant."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:74
msgid "This sensor is used to detect an object or a puck in front of the robot."
msgstr ""
"Ce capteur est utilisé pour détecter un objet ou un palet devant le robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:77
msgid "``isTouched()``"
msgstr "``isTouched()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:79
msgid "Returns ``true`` if the front touch sensor detects a collision."
msgstr ""
"Retourne ``true`` si le capteur de contact avant détecte une collision."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:82
msgid "``getAverageColor()``"
msgstr "``getAverageColor()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:84
msgid "Computes the average color detected by the camera."
msgstr "Calcule la couleur moyenne vue par la caméra."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The method returns an array ``{red, green, blue}``."
msgstr "La méthode retourne un tableau ``{red, green, blue}``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:88
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If the camera does not exist or if the image is invalid, it returns ``{0,"
" 0, 0}``."
msgstr ""
"Si la caméra n'existe pas ou si l'image n'est pas valide, elle retourne "
"``{0, 0, 0}``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:92
msgid "``isRedDetected()``"
msgstr "``isRedDetected()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:94
msgid "Indicates whether the detected average color corresponds to red."
msgstr ""
"Indique si la couleur moyenne détectée correspond à du rouge."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_sensors.rst:96
msgid ""
"The method checks that the red component is greater than 150, the green "
"component is lower than 100, and the blue component is lower than 100."
msgstr ""
"La méthode vérifie que le rouge est supérieur à 150, le vert inférieur à "
"100 et le bleu inférieur à 100."